      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T03:28:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SSC is the only owner of the signal strength states and action performer now. Any other telephony component (here SST) want to update the state (here reset signal strength value to default when switch the phone type) needs to ask SSC to perform it. Pls let me know if you have concern here. Thanks",
