        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T18:06:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d like the other components to ask SSC for signal strength updates, not SST, assuming that\u0027s a small change. Then we can just completely get SST out of the picture.",
      "parentUuid": "5e2a6843_06a93ce7",
      "revId": "4e05d81a332ea772016c7a25217002f6c7ce6761",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
