      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T18:29:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is great to completely get SST out for SS handling, just like what we did for DSM. Let\u0027s do it in follow-up CL. \n\nThis CL will serve a \"non-functional\" migration. Any non-minor optimization from original SST logic can be done later. In case there are regression introduced, we only need to handle the small optimization part, instead of this kind of structure change.",
      "parentUuid": "1f1cf414_05463cd9",
      "revId": "4e05d81a332ea772016c7a25217002f6c7ce6761",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
