      "writtenOn": "2021-10-21T00:53:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see this is public, so I presume some other object (like maybe Phone?) is invoking dispose here? If so, should that be the place where SSC#dispose() is being invoked? If the idea is to not have SSC be a sub-component of SST, that seems like the right thing to do.",
